        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Compounds 1–7 were prepared under the same conditions. Ln(ClO4)3 aqueous solution, Ni(ClO4)2·6H2O, HGly, H2IDA and deionized water were placed in a 20 mL scintillation vial. 1 M NaOH was used to adjust the pH to ~6.2. The solution was heated at 90 °C for 24 h and cooled to room temperature. Blue crystals were collected, washed three times with deionized water and dried in air.",
