        "summary": "Room-temperature χMT is 13.22 cm3 mol−1 K, larger than the spin-only value for nine Ni2+ ions with diamagnetic La3+. Upon cooling, χMT decreases slightly to 12.05 cm3 mol−1 K at 70 K, then rises to 16.63 cm3 mol−1 K near 4 K, and falls to 12.08 cm3 mol−1 K at 2 K. Overall ferrimagnetic-like Ni-based behaviour with very weak coupling.",
